WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:00.090 --> 00:00:01.210
- I have to tell you this story.

00:00:01.210 --> 00:00:04.960
So, I think having the double
mastectomy was the worst

00:00:04.960 --> 00:00:08.030
and the drains they put
in, not to get too graphic,

00:00:08.030 --> 00:00:10.140
I think it hit a nerve
so I was always fighting

00:00:10.140 --> 00:00:13.565
with my doctors for more pain medication.

00:00:13.565 --> 00:00:14.398
- [Kelly] Yeah.

00:00:14.398 --> 00:00:16.330
- Okay, so there was a
day that drains were out,

00:00:16.330 --> 00:00:19.310
gorgeous sunny day, feeling
free for the first time.

00:00:19.310 --> 00:00:21.870
I had these plate glass
windows onto this patio

00:00:21.870 --> 00:00:25.330
and wham, this little finch hit the window

00:00:25.330 --> 00:00:27.346
and fell on the bricks dead and I went,

00:00:27.346 --> 00:00:29.500
(deep exhale) "Great,
it's always something."

00:00:29.500 --> 00:00:33.470
So, I opened the door
and I put him in my hands

00:00:33.470 --> 00:00:35.730
and I sat out, you know how sometimes

00:00:35.730 --> 00:00:37.240
you think you can heal something?

00:00:37.240 --> 00:00:38.350
- Yeah like oh my God,
we're the same person.

00:00:38.350 --> 00:00:40.910
- And then you think, oh it's
blasphemy, it's blasphemy.

00:00:40.910 --> 00:00:41.800
- Yes (laughing) 'cause
you grew up in church.

00:00:41.800 --> 00:00:43.390
- So, I'm sitting there
and all of a sudden,

00:00:43.390 --> 00:00:46.980
he flips over in my hand and I mean,

00:00:46.980 --> 00:00:49.600
his head was hanging off my hand before

00:00:49.600 --> 00:00:53.090
and he flips over and I could
feel his tiny little claws

00:00:53.090 --> 00:00:57.000
and then his wings were
fine, his beak was fine,

00:00:57.000 --> 00:01:00.450
and my niece was there and
she's like the Francis of Assisi

00:01:00.450 --> 00:01:03.660
of our family so she just said,
"Oh, he wants some water."

00:01:03.660 --> 00:01:06.090
And I thought, dude, go.

00:01:06.090 --> 00:01:08.020
And so we put a little cup of water

00:01:08.020 --> 00:01:10.709
and we put her there and she
said, "Now, leave him alone."

00:01:10.709 --> 00:01:11.542
(laughing)

00:01:11.542 --> 00:01:13.080
'Cause she knows I wanna go mess with him,

00:01:13.080 --> 00:01:14.500
but then I couldn't leave him alone

00:01:14.500 --> 00:01:18.200
and I went back and he
flew off and I told Linda.

00:01:18.200 --> 00:01:20.290
I said, "He flew away."

00:01:20.290 --> 00:01:22.440
And she said, "Are you
getting the message?"

00:01:22.440 --> 00:01:25.024
And at first, I thought,
I can heal like Jesus.

00:01:25.024 --> 00:01:27.990
(audience laughing)

00:01:27.990 --> 00:01:28.823
- Gimme some water.

00:01:28.823 --> 00:01:30.020
- [Kathy] You know, right?
- Gimme some water.

00:01:30.020 --> 00:01:31.420
I'm gonna turn it into wine.

00:01:32.950 --> 00:01:37.917
- Totally and she said, "No,
you thought you were dead,

00:01:37.917 --> 00:01:39.850
"but now you can fly into a new life."

00:01:39.850 --> 00:01:41.970
- Oh my gosh, I love your niece.

00:01:41.970 --> 00:01:43.220
- I do too.

00:01:43.220 --> 00:01:44.710
- [Kelly] Yeah, what
a beautiful sentiment.

00:01:44.710 --> 00:01:47.790
- I mean, after that I just thought,

00:01:47.790 --> 00:01:49.190
everything's gonna be okay.

00:01:49.190 --> 00:01:51.130
- Yeah, those little moments man.

00:01:51.130 --> 00:01:51.963
- [Kathy] Huge, I still get chills.

00:01:51.963 --> 00:01:53.180
- They make huge impacts, yeah.

00:01:53.180 --> 00:01:54.663
- And it's a moment of grace.

00:01:55.530 --> 00:01:57.373
- [Kelly] And humility.
- [Women] Yeah.

